{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A run saved inside a bound call keeps %!event%: Log is bound before goal Work starts, saves the run there and keeps it\nin workspace/run.plang. Resumed, the run goes on from the save inside Log and reads %!event!item.name% again: the\nevent that fired, for the goal it fired for. The resumed run goes on through this goal too, from the step after\n`call Work`: the marker, written after the save, sends it to Resumed, which writes what it saw and ends it.",
